sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant P as Proposer
    participant A1 as Acceptor 1
    participant A2 as Acceptor 2
    participant A3 as Acceptor 3

    C->>P: propose value
    P->>A1: prepare(n)
    P->>A2: prepare(n)
    P->>A3: prepare(n)
    A1-->>P: promise
    A2-->>P: promise
    A3-->>P: promise
    P->>A1: accept(n, v)
    P->>A2: accept(n, v)
    P->>A3: accept(n, v)
